{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765219,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":null,"paid":0,"title":"Kaltarang Campus Ambassador Programme","festival_id":514119,"organization_id":108330,"web_url":"rgiptfest.com","start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-04T00:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"competitions","public_url":"competitions\/kaltarang-campus-ambassador-programme-kaltarang-26-rajiv-gandhi-institute-of-petroleum-technology-rgipt-jai-1765219","region":"online","details":"<p><strong>Kaltarang 2026<\/strong> is the cultural fest of <strong>Rajiv Gandhi Institute of Petroleum Technology (RGIPT)<\/strong>, taking place from <strong>31st October to 2nd November 2026<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>This year, Kaltarang brings you:<\/p>\n<p><strong>The city of unlived dreams<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>A place where you can be the person you've always wanted to be - a version of yourself you've never had the chance to explore.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>About the Campus Ambassador Programme<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>We're looking for enthusiastic students across colleges to become <strong>Kaltarang Campus Ambassadors<\/strong> and bring the <strong>City of Unlived Dreams<\/strong> to their campuses.<\/p>\n<p>As a Campus Ambassador, you will:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Represent Kaltarang in your college<\/li>\n<li>Encourage registrations and participation<\/li>\n<li>Create awareness and excitement for Kaltarang<\/li>\n<li>Gain hands-on experience in leadership, marketing and networking<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Duration:<\/strong> Until the conclusion of Kaltarang - <strong>31st October to 2nd November 2026<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Eligibility<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to <strong>all college students<\/strong>, irrespective of year or branch<\/li>\n<li>Good communication and networking skills preferred<\/li>\n<li>Active presence on Instagram, WhatsApp and\/or college community groups preferred<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Learning &amp; Growth Opportunities<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Joining as a CA will help you:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Develop leadership skills by representing your college<\/li>\n<li>Gain practical experience in digital and offline promotion<\/li>\n<li>Expand your network with organizers and ambassadors across India<\/li>\n<li>Showcase creativity and strategy in campus engagement<\/li>\n<li>Earn certificates, recognition and Letters of Recommendation (LoRs) based on your performance<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Responsibilities<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>1. Social Media Promotion<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Share official Kaltarang posters, stories and announcements<\/li>\n<li>Promote Kaltarang on Instagram and other relevant platforms<\/li>\n<li>Share posts and registration links in college\/community groups<\/li>\n<li>Submit screenshots and links as proof when required<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>2. Offline Promotion<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Display official posters in college notice boards, canteens, club areas, etc.<\/li>\n<li>Submit photo\/video proof where required<\/li>\n<li>Earn bonus points for creativity and teamwork in promotion<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>3. Performance Metrics<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>Each CA will be evaluated based on:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Registrations using your unique CA code:<\/strong> 250 points per registration<\/li>\n<li><strong>Poster display proof:<\/strong> 50 points<\/li>\n<li><strong>Social media post\/repost\/story proof:<\/strong> 15 points<\/li>\n<li><strong>Engagement:<\/strong> 5 points<\/li>\n<li><strong>Consistency and creativity in promotion:<\/strong> Up to 20 bonus points<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Referral Code System<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each CA will receive a <strong>unique referral code<\/strong> for participants to use while registering.<\/li>\n<li>For every <strong>20 successful registrations<\/strong>, the CA earns <strong>1 free Golden Pass<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li>The pass is valid only if the CA attends Kaltarang in person.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Perks &amp; Rewards<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Top 3 Campus Ambassadors:<\/strong> Free Golden Pass, exclusive merchandise, Certificate of Excellence and Letter of Recommendation (LoR)<\/li>\n<li><strong>Top 5 Campus Ambassadors:<\/strong> Official merchandise, Certificate of Appreciation and LoR<\/li>\n<li><strong>CAs with 5+ registrations:<\/strong> Digital Certificate and LoR<\/li>\n<li><strong>All Active Campus Ambassadors:<\/strong> Certificate of Participation<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Submission Procedure<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>All proofs - including screenshots, poster photos and registration details - must be submitted through the official <strong>CA Portal \/ Google Form<\/strong> shared via email or WhatsApp.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Why Join Kaltarang?<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Build a national network with students and student leaders<\/li>\n<li>Develop leadership, communication and marketing skills<\/li>\n<li>Earn official certificates, recognition and LoRs<\/li>\n<li>Get exclusive access to the Kaltarang organizing community and premium events<\/li>\n<li>Win exciting rewards and Golden Passes<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<h3><strong>Bring your campus to the City of Unlived Dreams. <\/strong><\/h3>\n<p><strong>Kaltarang 2026 | 31st October &ndash; 2nd November<\/strong><\/p>","overall_prizes":null,"regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":9029411,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-03T12:30:31+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T20:45:23+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"general_competition","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":null,"short_id":"rRQBF94","hashtags":null,"participation_certificate":0,"winner_certificate_at":null,"listed":1,"self_moderated":2,"prizes_release_days":null,"checked":null,"display_title":null,"show_discussions_only_user":1,"show_review